OL,3,GNEWSAChurch makes sainthood case for
OL,4,A'WW1 hero' priest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "heroic" Irish priest who was killed
OL,7,Fin World War One while trying to help
OL,8,Finjured and dying soldiers has taken a
OL,9,Fstep towards potential sainthood.
OL,11,FFr Willie Doyle served as a British
OL,12,FArmy chaplain during some of the
OL,13,Fbloodiest battles of the First World
OL,14,FWar, including the Somme, Messines and
OL,15,FPasschendaele.
OL,17,FThe Dubliner was renowned for his
OL,18,Fcourage under fire, repeatedly running
OL,19,Finto No Man's Land to carry wounded
OL,20,Ftroops to safety or to comfort those
OL,21,Ffatally injured.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
