OL,3,GNEWSAChurch makes sainthood case for
OL,4,A'WW1 hero' priest
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Sunday, the Catholic Church in
OL,7,FIreland held a special service in
OL,8,FMullingar Cathedral as it prepares to
OL,9,Fsend thousands of documents to the
OL,10,FVatican to support the case for his
OL,11,Fcanonisation.
